                <pb facs="0562" n="555" sameAs="frus:frus1937v03/pg555"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/10268: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-09-27T20:00:00-05:00">September 27, 1937—8
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>233. Nanking reports that in Japanese bombing there on September 25, 500-pound
                    bombs fell on four sides of French Embassy not 100 yards distant.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
